  "meta": {
    "description": "Lead intake webhook for the portfolio contact form. Receives a JSON POST at /webhook/aniket-leads, validates the required fields (name, email, workflow_broken) plus a basic email format check, writes the lead to the Airtable 'Prospects' base / 'Leads' table with Stage 'Engaged', emails Aniket and auto-replies to the sender via Gmail, then responds 200 with { status: 'ok', lead_id }. Invalid payloads respond 400 with { status: 400, error: 'missing_required_fields' }. Airtable failures hard-fail with 500; Gmail failures still return 200 with a warning field."
  },
